Sinclair’s hypothesis of a connection between resveratrol, sirtuins and metabolic
activity in mammals. Several pharmaceutical companies began talking with
Westphal about a possible drug development partnership. He anticipated that
the terms of a deal could include a significant upfront cash payment, an equity
purchase agreement, guaranteed R&D support that would likely step up over a
four to five year period, and payments tied to clinical development milestones.
